Third-party data — NOT redistributed here:

  The creditcard.csv benchmark (284,807 transactions) is maintained by the
  Machine Learning Group of the Université Libre de Bruxelles in collaboration
  with Worldline, and distributed via Kaggle. It is NOT included in this
  package. scripts/get_data.py fetches it from its public source and verifies
  the SHA-256 recorded in configs/run.json and in the run manifest, aborting on
  mismatch — so the data-to-results chain stays verifiable without this
  repository redistributing third-party material. The dataset remains under the
  terms of its original distributor; cite Dal Pozzolo (2015) and ULB/Worldline
  (2013) as the paper's reference list does.

The derived outputs in output/ (results.json, scores, tables, figures) are
products of this code over that data and fall under the licensing above.
